usage: audit_count.py [-h] [--locations FILE] [--repository KEY]
                      [--prices FILE] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]

The counting command of the audit of the process: the cycles whose records the
user's repositories hold in their history, and for each the version of the-way
it ran on, its number of process remarks and its times (WAY-330); and the
problems of the user's register of problems counted against those cycles
(WAY-330).

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  --locations FILE
  --repository KEY
  --prices FILE
  --today YYYY-MM-DD
